  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>In the extraction of copper from its sulphide ore, metal is finally obtained by the oxidation of cuprous sulphide with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>. ​ It is an example of auto reduction.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>Cu</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><br />&nbsp;</p></blockquote>",
